                                        "name": "William",
                                        "rating": 5,
                                        "source": "Reviewed on staples.com",
                                        "text": "I was looking for a cable that was resistant to breaking due to multiple bending and twisting near the connection. It also had to be resistant to my bunnies chewing on the cable. This cable is stiffer due to the harder covering. That covering is also textured which my bunnies don’t like so no chewing. So this cable wins on two fronts. I kno there are many bunny owners out there but the stiffness of cable makes this a good cable for anyone that moves their equipment around frequently.",
